# SkillSpector 2.5.1 command-line runtime dependencies.
#
# Version ranges are copied from the NVIDIA v2.5.1 wheel metadata so uv can
# choose versions that actually exist in the configured company index.  The
# wheel also declares langgraph-cli[inmem]>=0.4.14, but no SkillSpector runtime
# module imports langgraph_cli.  That optional LangGraph Studio development
# server is intentionally excluded from the scanner runtime.
